            <div xml:id="m-f079c1af-b5d6-43ff-98d1-ff99b195f079">
              <lg xml:id="m-d616e921-47a8-44ab-aa1f-e66ef2ee7fcf">
                <l xml:id="m-778130bc-f894-4dfb-9940-143e658e7e2c" facs="#m-af8825f7-3272-42b5-9ca8-9f588ed2cd5f" label="text-like">loth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-b6e79f86-6a1f-44d0-acc7-0d84e5ec8266" facs="#m-0c4016bb-27d7-4f2e-84b2-04b2d9590db1" label="ambiguous">1023</l><l xml:id="m-fa120dce-217c-4377-b549-3c1889df3d48" facs="#m-01d3dc64-660e-41c5-9945-b8ac86a5d4e7" label="ambiguous">TSequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 18. b.</l><l xml:id="m-e0fa1e4c-17b7-415d-9d63-b7529f9c587c" facs="#m-a3d0ad9a-5a28-469a-a326-ee3e2a872fd6" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Dixit Jesus ad bis in sábbato: décimas doómnium,</l><l xml:id="m-bf2bb26a-2d99-420e-8463-24aeea1db1c1" facs="#m-f100b383-5935-446a-9aa1-09a5105ebd1b" label="lyrics-like">L quosdam, qui in se confidébant</l><l xml:id="m-8b7c9962-778a-48ad-9425-0cb8e16c5b61" facs="#m-58b1695f-ff44-4b6e-9bd6-0e364fe13d2d" label="lyrics-like">quae possídeo. Et publicánusa</l><l xml:id="m-a88613cc-bc76-4390-b5a4-b3fc13f9f788" facs="#m-f802042a-b832-4a3e-b184-ac349d177966" label="lyrics-like">tamquam justi, et aspernabántur</l><l xml:id="m-456260fd-9a44-4eb5-9a17-743532949ca4" facs="#m-0fe902cc-655a-4892-8543-4f29d5410502" label="lyrics-like">longe stans, nolébat nec óculos ad</l><l xml:id="m-056555c8-330b-4058-a092-b259e19ff2aa" facs="#m-c7f7da56-afb3-48eb-88d7-2995c3ddd630" label="lyrics-like">céteros, parábolam istam: Duo hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0fd26ec8-5bf3-4d05-9489-a89fbb00b928" facs="#m-6f5323b8-c8f9-4a40-8da4-96b833c132c4" label="lyrics-like">caelum leváre: sed percutiébat pe¬</l><l xml:id="m-4d084fcd-8bba-486b-ab9e-af0be63a9bbd" facs="#m-866128d5-ff7a-4e33-9c3b-b88bbbe2009d" label="ambiguous">ctus suum, dicens: Deus, propitius</l><l xml:id="m-1a6ea124-b29f-4cb0-be19-288307af21dc" facs="#m-320df665-83cf-4e06-8890-ff59f3a0c10b" label="lyrics-like">mines ascendérunt in templum ut</l><l xml:id="m-c37b060e-6753-4224-a215-47f5cf1d33bb" facs="#m-0f8d2347-52cf-41e1-bf52-66c49e5914fa" label="lyrics-like">orárent: unus pharisaéus, et alter</l><l xml:id="m-fb5b624b-b3d0-4d38-ab07-3d6d68ad936a" facs="#m-8e513332-407a-47b8-b3a0-1921401a6571" label="lyrics-like">esto mihi peccatóri. Dico vobis:</l><l xml:id="m-1d6342a2-429a-4277-843a-328a6a080721" facs="#m-f10abe58-e0d2-4554-be13-87c1a9a39bbc" label="lyrics-like">descéndit hic justificátus in domum</l><l xml:id="m-0148f9b7-b266-4ec5-9c4c-060ebef9d43a" facs="#m-e0f5f36c-a892-46e1-841c-8e916bd02240" label="lyrics-like">publicánus. Pharisaéus stans, haec</l><l xml:id="m-177534ce-104f-42ba-a8ff-ebb65034d223" facs="#m-316600e7-d076-416a-808a-c8453f78187f" label="lyrics-like">apud se orábat: Deus, grátias ago</l><l xml:id="m-7156d2e9-a742-4fae-bf7a-4bc3c51595e2" facs="#m-f976d9b6-7e7a-4c5c-b561-7a7e23d99428" label="ambiguous">suam ab illo : quia omnis qui se</l><l xml:id="m-503d1dea-2c3f-43f7-a90a-0e006875f2e9" facs="#m-e24a430c-ea42-4a8c-8403-42a40cbca74e" label="lyrics-like">tibi, quia non sum sicut céteri hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-20188e00-23bc-4713-adfd-5558a514e583" facs="#m-309fb681-1d9a-4fc6-9509-0554a1c87d68" label="lyrics-like">exáltat, humiliábitur : et qui se hu¬</l><l xml:id="m-0c416f50-7e04-40ff-913b-474b8a72710a" facs="#m-d58f01a3-2dae-4ede-99ed-1d6da0dc30e7" label="lyrics-like">minum : raptóres, injústi, adúlteri :</l><l xml:id="m-adc90704-3dba-4291-bf6f-bc81f3679b6d" facs="#m-163a0faf-509b-42ff-8752-f432dd791497" label="lyrics-like">miliat, exaltábitur.</l><l xml:id="m-e0005793-56a2-45ce-b076-e785c6f9e476" facs="#m-45fad595-1b50-4262-9174-856b964a8f96" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-183a1deb-d916-4371-bb8d-efe5d99d0c56" facs="#m-c23f1b5f-edf7-481f-a0d7-75196b4150a4" label="lyrics-like">velut étiam hic publicánus. Jejúno</l><l xml:id="m-a6b5d2a8-d19e-4b33-bfdf-4275aa173efa" facs="#m-c0b45259-5044-4020-980f-c78d710e8fc6" label="lyrics-like">offertory. Ad te Dómine levávi. D. 321.</l><l xml:id="m-e96c05f6-e711-4e27-8b18-872c05409475" facs="#m-f43fbdfc-68df-4b9c-8cdc-1d5a06e0a612" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-f6dc6011-0279-4313-8167-c742e08f23c4" facs="#m-42d1f571-85b3-4c76-8380-a390e811bda9" label="lyrics-like">TVIbi, Dómine, sacrificia dicáta ut éadem remédia fieri nostra prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-0909c794-2cee-422f-b4ee-2583ff73a37d" facs="#m-cf3bccb3-13ca-4696-a4e0-33093a6bde7d" label="lyrics-like">reddántur: quae sic ad honó- stáres. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-f5b15cce-4aa7-4303-9eb4-6ccf10ce5432" facs="#m-5af03378-b017-454f-b7c2-8434f68160ba" label="lyrics-like">rem nóminis tui deferénda tribuisti,</l><l xml:id="m-bfbae162-f03c-4e67-8f2b-05e23274e08c" facs="#m-ec536dec-c0e9-4e5a-8740-8910af24bdb5" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-49e20025-09db-4a84-a5c7-876f36774c70" facs="#m-dd98f7cf-da48-4ac0-bbde-a5fae6b2d197" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-f86c7dda-db94-44c6-910e-a6251b3b4bbf" facs="#m-8ddf22a0-7883-4f31-8681-c89deb85a3c3" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-ae2ce4f6-7691-4ee1-a67b-bd6a5414c1a2" facs="#m-ec56479b-d375-4b2f-a13d-f3da806fb740" label="lyrics-like">stí-ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-4989cf63-25e5-4360-9857-6782ac0c13eb" facs="#m-72e60af2-d011-439b-a351-9a1290deeadc" label="lyrics-like">ACceptá¬</l><l xml:id="m-9ed09c25-e908-43c8-b4d8-8b124fe21b73" facs="#m-256e9fd7-b9b9-4c94-9003-14e24abe4538" label="ambiguous">bis “ sacri-fi- ci-um ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-b09de5a7-5a10-47f0-8986-330f1ee8dbbb" facs="#m-5622264c-a99c-41d6-ade4-b10775a28672" label="lyrics-like">obla-ti-ónes et ho-lo-cáu-sta,</l><l xml:id="m-4c3efd5f-cc99-483c-af09-b6f2d6af56c5" facs="#m-be8e6bb8-8232-438d-958e-eab1c27b158f" label="ambiguous">per al¬</l><l xml:id="m-6fce96a5-a388-4e6d-905a-9e91fe7c8a44" facs="#m-0d921a83-29dc-4702-b8a9-b1e8b62060a9" label="ambiguous">su¬</l><l xml:id="m-7e6cec24-d4c4-4880-9899-d65d4ce778e8" facs="#m-4b4d4057-54b9-4c33-99b2-922a3dca472f" label="ambiguous">ae,</l><l xml:id="m-233a2f7b-34a6-4f60-80ea-66d15cc81611" facs="#m-261674af-ce6c-482e-9e84-4f166531ed80" label="lyrics-like">tá¬ re tú- um, Dómi- ne.</l><l xml:id="m-09d9b34e-4ad5-4792-a441-9d2125c403b5" facs="#m-2e667833-bc48-4eeb-bf55-bb825507a553" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-da5429a7-b97f-4909-b886-4768437d40df" facs="#m-8bc64440-1a71-4918-bbe2-b86f12d4fd7e" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus, Dómine Deus no- destituas benígnus auxíliis. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-a4c09bf9-b5ee-438c-bb73-960701816af5" facs="#m-a5468d16-7f3e-4990-9aa5-3df8c4a33b88" label="lyrics-like">Uster : ut quos divinis reparáre minum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-ec15b136-6928-4e69-9c4d-a906bd31d7a3" facs="#m-27234e22-397b-44d5-9732-2b9d8ec153b5" label="lyrics-like">non désinis sacraméntis, tuis non</l><l xml:id="m-41089936-106c-4fe0-ba4e-33e5d0d4ecdf" facs="#m-b92b7e2e-ba91-42c7-8c80-89ea8b60f12f" label="lyrics-like">2. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-ea1540f2-a331-4f4c-a505-1b8d3531d68b" facs="#m-570a8299-fe5d-4557-b651-145befe6b30f" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-03695d8d-c0ab-4257-9a3b-4deaf00a5919" facs="#m-a055420e-3625-4f3e-86e8-2df5dabee36d" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-042aa831-98b5-4279-9eb7-f9ee07c5b78f" facs="#m-99df1faf-c211-4baa-938f-7af920770e1b" label="ambiguous">Ant. S. G</l><l xml:id="m-bbbfe8b4-8673-4e8e-8a65-9e06dc413818" facs="#m-41b4b88e-a65e-4553-870d-53ae7ed8234b" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-aa7bc188-776b-4e96-9534-023dcd6b3618" facs="#m-59511785-a4da-4c10-8199-60728f1c607b" label="lyrics-like">Escéndit hic“ justi-fi-cá¬ tus in dómum sú-am</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>